# Terraform state and variables: may contain IDs, paths and, on VM, generated SSH keys.
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
**/.terraform.lock.hcl.bak
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Operator local configuration and deployment artifacts.
deployment.json
build/
labs/2026-10-lab-fg-phpflaws/
# Secrets and credentials: safety net, none should ever live in the repo.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*-key.json
*kubeconfig*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
